<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐσύρα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goat's-hair cloak</i>, used as a garment by day and a
			coverlet by night, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1450
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				738
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				347
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				933
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				122
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πέντε ς. ἐγκεκορδυλημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. δερματίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Erx.</u>
					400e
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίσυρνα, σίσυς</span>.—<i><span class="en">
				Tz.
			</span></i> (ad <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				634
			</span></i>) distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σισύρα</span> as
			made <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δέρματος ἐντρίχου</span> from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίσυρνα</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτριχον δερμάτιον</span>
			.</div>
